ams I wanted to spend the semester  abroad so I don't really have a problem  with that I'm more worried about whether  this will affect me psychologically the  Bundeswehr is investing heavily in  attracting talent it just spent some  eight million euros on its latest image  campaign the YouTube series 12 recruits  got millions of clicks but it has yet to  prove that it will help fill the gaps in  the ranks of Bundeswehr recruits
 

